  ### `:page_close`

  *Since Playwright 1.60.* Emitted when a page in this context is closed. See also [`Page.on(:close)`](PlaywrightEx.Page.html#module-close) to receive events about a specific page.

  ### `:page_load`

  *Since Playwright 1.60.* Emitted when the JavaScript [`load`](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/Events/load) event is dispatched in any page belonging to this context. See also [`Page.on(:load)`](PlaywrightEx.Page.html#module-load) to receive events about a specific page.

  ### `:web_error`

  *Since Playwright 1.38.* Emitted when exception is unhandled in any of the pages in this
  context. To listen for errors from a particular page, use [`Page.on(:page_error)`](PlaywrightEx.Page.html#module-page_error) instead.

  ### `:request`

  *Since Playwright 1.12.* Emitted when a request is issued from any pages created through this context.
  The [`Request`](`PlaywrightEx.Request`) object is read-only. To only listen for requests from a particular
  page, use [`Page.on(:request)`](PlaywrightEx.Page.html#module-request).

